- Gates: 712x400, 24 fps, 3,802 frames, 158.416667 s; luma max |dYAVG| 4.34, 0 jumps > 8, 0 black; palette clean; frame 2000 byte-identical; string audit clean. Compute 0.28 node-h total (both passes + prep/QA), aletheia-core, peak Tctl 76.4 C, no >=80 C events.
